---
description: Telugu full female name. THE FAMILY NAME COMES FIRST — house name then given name (అక్కినేని సావిత్రి), the reverse of the English and Hindi order. The family name is drawn from person/lastName.txt, the same list a male row uses, because Telugu family names do NOT inflect for gender; there is deliberately no person/female/lastName.txt to draw from.
generator: tdc
locale: te
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="te.person.lastName"/>
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="te.person.female.firstName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.l}} ${{p.f}}</data>
